1
00:00:00,036 --> 00:00:04,859
Kesultanan Kutai ternyata pernah mengutus
abdinya menjemput 2 manusia berekor...

2
00:00:04,859 --> 00:00:07,416
dan utusannya malah diancam dicambuk!

3
00:00:07,416 --> 00:00:10,263
Abdi itu mengaku pernah
melihat mereka di Paser...

4
00:00:10,263 --> 00:00:11,269
katanya,

5
00:00:11,269 --> 00:00:13,717
mereka melubangi lantai supaya bisa duduk!

6
00:00:13,717 --> 00:00:15,694
Penjelajah Eropa tak percaya,

7
00:00:15,694 --> 00:00:17,833
tapi sultan terkesan.

8
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:19,696
Abdi itu diutus membawa surat.

9
00:00:19,696 --> 00:00:20,589
Hasilnya?

10
00:00:20,589 --> 00:00:21,423
Diusir,

11
00:00:21,423 --> 00:00:22,706
pulang tangan kosong.

12
00:00:22,706 --> 00:00:24,071
Ternyata di Paser,

13
00:00:24,071 --> 00:00:27,167
"orang buntut" cuma sebutan
untuk pengiring pribadi sultan!

14
00:00:27,167 --> 00:00:27,733
Follow,

15
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,974
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
